WEBVTT

1
00:00.000 --> 00:02.100
Begin with the channel source library. Keep names, versions, and processing state.

2
00:02.100 --> 00:04.200
One Import dialog for files, links, pasted notes, and planned cloud connections.

3
00:04.200 --> 00:06.300
Each sample import processes independently. No real file or service is used.

4
00:06.300 --> 00:08.400
Names remain visible: two sample items are ready; one needs caption permission.

5
00:08.400 --> 00:10.500
Compose in one Studio: editable document and docked assistant share selected sources.

6
00:10.500 --> 00:12.600
Apply only the proposed selection. The rest of the study remains yours.

7
00:12.600 --> 00:14.700
Undo restores the previous text in the same workspace.

8
00:14.700 --> 00:16.800
Switch to Design for flexible placements. Logical reading order remains explicit.

9
00:16.800 --> 00:18.900
Preview the same authored content in its accessible logical order.
